<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Transition started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Transition started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest Securities initiated coverage of Transition Systems with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Shares increased 1-7/16 to 9-15/16.</p>
<p>-- Current valuation significantly discounts historical and projected revenues and profit growth.</p>
<p>-- Recent acquisitions and product development have expanded product line and creates opportunities for repeat sales.</p>
<p>-- Sets 12-month price target of $20 a share.</p>
</text>
